      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At a glittering Tokyo disco, a popular young starlet basks in admiration from her companions while brushing off club staff. Back at the office, Kawada and Muranishi study her latest video from rival studio Poseidon. Listen to the Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
